:"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ふむふむ","ts":"1620715745.163200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lahm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad6469d8-228d-47a0-bdb5-2cbee3f46b7d","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"自分の場合、副業規定で禁止されているので対価とれない","ts":"1620715690.163100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"majika","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]},{"name":"hee","count":2,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n0ce"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b905876d-576f-4e19-8d0f-61219896c489","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"確定申告は、\n\n1. 支払いをクレカ等の電子決済にする\n2. 紙の領収書は、医療明細を除いて捨てる（10万円以上のものは例外として保管）\n3. 支払調書、保険の支払明細を保管する\n4. 支払いの中から、経費になりそうなものの金額を集計する\n5. E-Taxに入力する\n6. 提出する\nくらいなので、慣れると2時間くらいでできますよ。\nとりあえず、紙の明細は年別のファイルにでも入れておけば紛失もしないし、探さなくてよいです。","ts":"1620715677.162800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vJsWY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0bc62c7-ac62-4f8e-8603-35dad475899e","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"Vimに時間を作ることでおかねをつかうひまがなくなるというこうかもある","ts":"1620715625.161900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rc=/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f4eff3e-43b3-4c1c-bf5c-72451b242ae6","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"本業にするのは無理でも少なくとも副業はしなくてよくなるだろう","ts":"1620715590.161200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dpz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6322f67-6512-4144-a535-ac697e967969","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"お金の余裕があることでOSS活動に専念できるというのはあると思う","ts":"1620715569.160900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"COZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec89f1e3-eea7-426a-a04f-e38a629f85bd","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"「プラグインがおいしかったよ(食い物風に)」で投げてくれる